### 东信和平亮灯接口测试
### 基础地址（按 application-dongxingheping.yml）
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8090

### 1. 拣货数据上传-成功
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/picking/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV202603250001",
  "userId": "USER001",
  "userName": "张三",
  "updateTime": 1648195200000,
  "details": [
    {
      "id": "DTL001",
      "materialCode": "MAT001",
      "batchNo": "B20260325",
      "locationCode": "A-01-02",
      "planQuantity": 100,
      "actualQuantity": 0,
      "status": 0
    }
  ]
}

### 2. 拣货完成-成功
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/picking/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV202603250001",
  "userId": "USER001",
  "details": [
    {
      "materialCode": "MAT001",
      "batchNo": "B20260325",
      "locationCode": "A-01-02",
      "planQuantity": 100,
      "actualQuantity": 100,
      "updateTime": 1648195200000
    }
  ]
}

### 3. 亮灯灭灯控制-成功
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/control
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV202603250001",
  "userId": "USER001",
  "mode": 1,
  "color": "GREEN",
  "duration": "inf"
}

### 4. 灭灯控制-成功
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/control/off
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV202603250001",
  "userId": "USER001",
  "mode": 1
}

### 5. 参数错误-缺少waveNo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/picking/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "USER001",
  "updateTime": 1648195200000,
  "details": [
    {
      "id": "DTL001",
      "materialCode": "MAT001",
      "batchNo": "B20260325",
      "locationCode": "A-01-02",
      "planQuantity": 100,
      "actualQuantity": 0,
      "status": 0
    }
  ]
}

### 6. 参数错误-mode非法
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/control
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV202603250001",
  "userId": "USER001",
  "mode": 9,
  "color": "GREEN",
  "duration": "inf"
}

### 7. 参数错误-负数数量
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/picking/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV202603250001",
  "userId": "USER001",
  "details": [
    {
      "materialCode": "MAT001",
      "batchNo": "B20260325",
      "locationCode": "A-01-02",
      "planQuantity": -1,
      "actualQuantity": 100,
      "updateTime": 1648195200000
    }
  ]
}

### 8. 参数错误-details为空
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/picking/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV202603250001",
  "userId": "USER001",
  "updateTime": 1648195200000,
  "details": []
}

### 9. 异常路径验证建议
### 执行前临时将 t_light_control_log 重命名，再请求 /api/light/control，预期返回500；验证后恢复表名。